    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I used a simple AI tool to help me understand basic algebra when I was studying for a computer science course. It broke down problems into smaller parts and gave me feedback. It wasn’t perfect, and sometimes I had to rework things, but it made things a lot less intimidating. It’s like having a friendly tutor who’s always available.",
